# Vicious Verse deals exactly one to an opponent and immediately grants only the Wordsmith flying and haste.
# The haste allows a same-turn attack, and the history condition resets next turn (CR 611.3a, 722.3c).
[Bot1 Deck]
Whiplash Wordsmith
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain x15
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x22
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
