Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Whiplash Wordsmith.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Whiplash Wordsmith.Prepared = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Whiplash Wordsmith.Keywords = (absent)
! Bot1.Exile.Vicious Verse.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
